      "postDate": "2026-07-09T16:55:59.110Z",
      "rawMarkdown": "repo: https://github.com/tom99763/celltrack-studio \n\n* support uploading script to test your own post-processing\n* know your score on this video\n* check your matching between frame t to frame t+1\n* observe your predicted trajectories and errors in 3d view \n\n\n![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F4310004%2Fcbfe42f675f3d938ab23b511046f224a%2Fnapari.png?generation=1783616306670559&alt=media)\n\n",
      "content": "<p>repo: <a href=\"https://github.com/tom99763/celltrack-studio\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/tom99763/celltrack-studio</a> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>support uploading script to test your own post-processing</li>\n<li>know your score on this video</li>\n<li>check your matching between frame t to frame t+1</li>\n<li>observe your predicted trajectories and errors in 3d view </li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F4310004%2Fcbfe42f675f3d938ab23b511046f224a%2Fnapari.png?generation=1783616306670559&amp;alt=media\" alt=\"\"></p>",
